      "type": "note",
      "text": "Clicking anywhere on a room's row (both tables) opens the room page; the <b>ballot</b> link appears only after that room's motion is published, and reads <b>edit ballot</b> once a ballot is in (lock handling is internal). <b>Fill ballot — R#</b> shows when the head chairs a room. <b>Delete rooms</b> (rooms gone, registration open again) shows only while every room is waiting to start. Finish records the winners on the session row. A head opening the participant page of an unfinished session is sent here. The <b>Feedback</b> column counts the teams that have sent feedback on that room's adjudicator; the Feedback list shows every form with the sending team — progress and senders are the head's alone (an adjudicator who is also the head is not restricted)."
